aste to-steam (WTS) generation projects and centralized pipeline distribution infrastructure for industrial consumers. It serves pharmaceuticals, chemicals, agrochemicals, textiles, tyres, dyes and pigments, polymers, paints, food processing, paper, and other manufacturing sectors. Steamhouse India Limited was formerly known as Ankleshwar Eco Energy Limited and changed its name to Steamhouse India Limited in September 2021. Steamhouse India Limited was founded in 2014 and is based in Surat, India with additional offices in Ankleshwar, Vapi, Sarigam, Nandesari, and Panoli, India.","employees":null,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":null,"asOf":1795440939},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795440939,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"STEAMHOUSE INDIA\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Steamhouse India Ltd. Share Price Today - Steamhouse India Ltd. Stock Price Live NSE/BSE","s":"CNBC TV18","d":1795168800,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPSTM4cFpoRUdjMWF1bXJVd0hROVRFV1g3WWJvM1EzWXBfUU5pWUZDQWR5bHNGc2FtX0VmcG1WbEVkc1FXVWtfandiblVQZVhsZUdHMHpVcUttQXJYd1JzUGpidHpaRHpXaEgzcXQ1eFl1YlFQT1BZcF9RYmc0X1lEeVJfdWkyZw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Steamhouse India Ltd is Rated Sell","s":"MarketsMojo","d":1793458129,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQMC0xRkR0Zm0xdjJ2OUg5SVBJN0R4ckZSNEhlR3ZJZENvN0VrcUM3RDRZOHUzdDlDZkg4Vlhpcld0cTRwcHA4VVdtOGVLWks0b3JVcGFjcm1ZczlFdjdFMmFtZlF6Z2Zqa0VONHh1NVBpbDNYY0dXN0J1WjB4ZWpLUUxWRnpaSHJVZ21mWDJUNkE5SXZ3Vnp5R0xzSXA?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Steamhouse India Q2 Profit Soars 167% to Rs 7.77 Cr","s":"Rediff MoneyWiz","d":1793257200,"u":"https://news.google.?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Steamhouse India Signs MoU With Haryana to Explore Rs 500 Cr","s":"Equitypandit","d":1793170800,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxON3FZNll4czhCSzV0aFY3QUxDekFlM3EwRnYzNC1GYUdCNkUtZ190VDFIUi1lRUQ0X29XSkJMX2ZsakYxRWxwclJLaHZyRmNibnNnWm9VZkZZQnNhZXg2bEdCOFRFMm1mTH